WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.835
Liquid Metal responds to your fingertips.

00:00:07.835 --> 00:00:11.237
Tap for a ripple, then drag to shape the field.

00:00:11.237 --> 00:00:15.754
Hold to concentrate an energy well.

00:00:15.754 --> 00:00:28.594
Generate a new composition and save it locally.

00:00:28.594 --> 00:00:46.602
Explore luminous clouds and particles in Nebula.

00:00:46.602 --> 00:01:04.583
Shape layered color in Ink.

00:01:04.583 --> 00:01:19.747
Bend flowing ribbons of light in Aurora.

00:01:19.747 --> 00:01:28.975
Choose from eight coordinated palettes.

00:01:28.975 --> 00:01:42.693
Reopen favorite worlds from your private Collection.

00:01:42.693 --> 00:01:47.537
Render a high-resolution PNG and use native sharing.

00:01:47.537 --> 00:01:52.648
Adjust quality, haptics, ambient animation and motion.

00:01:52.648 --> 00:01:55.992
Privacy Policy and Support are available in Settings.

00:01:55.992 --> 00:01:59.792
Touch the impossible.
